[{"title":"丁参戎邀游明山六祖寺","author":"江源","text":"会昌河北明山清，一方之镇储精英。\n青苍峻峭插霄汉，无乃天造地设成。\n上有千林乔木之蓊郁，下有六祖禅室之峥嵘。\n寒泉瀑布几千尺，奔流入涧归沧溟。\n登高胡不振我衣，临清胡不濯我缨。\n元戎邀我此游赏，况值公暇兼升平。\n主宾联辔惬心赏，四美具兮二难并。\n元戎韬略更文雅，执手相看如故情。\n剑亦不须按，盖亦不用倾。\n酌我金陵琥珀之美酒，荐我太官适口之羊羹。\n食我东南水陆之嘉果，饭我冬春玉粒之香粳。\n投壶百罚不辞醉，抚掌一叹俱忘形。\n我日既云迈，而月亦斯征。\n相逢不一醉，徒叹三闾醒。\n明朝揖君与君别，观风又向桃江行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51967,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松竹梅三友图","author":"江源","text":"徂徕老龙几千尺，饮历风霜自朝夕。\n淇园君子更孤高，罗浮仙人何洁白。\n相逢便结岁寒盟，丰姿虽异同坚贞。\n此心不为岁时改，百年莫逆敦高情。\n平生误入丁固梦，清标羞作伶伦用。\n暗香疏影迥出尘，一时嬴得逋诗重。\n我生潇洒厌烦污，爱尔贤哉三丈夫。\n个中着我便成四，不识君辈能容无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51968,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岭南百咏送卞式之归毗陵","author":"江源","text":"岭南风景天下稀，山水眼前真崛奇。\n向来有客恣游赏，可是毗陵卞式之。\n振衣爱上番山秀，寻仙再挹浮丘袖。\n波罗庙前春浪多，粤王台上风烟旧。\n柳波涌头听竹枝，杏花村里招酒旗。\n寒翠亭留大苏墨，远华楼扁方孚诗。\n朝汉台荒走群鹿，望海楼高送双目。\n厓门吊古夕阳斜，海珠舣棹春潮绿。\n五仙楼阁齐斗箕，九曜碣石浮连漪。\n濂溪院前拜周子，白云山上访安期。\n西樵峰峦齐泰岱，南华衣钵知何代。\n六榕僧暇类懒残，三洲岩深足奇怪。\n锦溪石无三品封，白莲池有双头红。\n荔枝湾头酌明月，花林院里闻晨钟。\n金牛山长瞰江测，松风阁与红尘隔。\n合江绝胜多景楼，梅溪好似孤山宅。\n苏仙井古谁浚源，达磨泉深汲不浑。\n菖蒲生涧仙已去，沉香弃水亭犹存。\n罗浮奇绝不可述，西岩巇崄谁曾入。\n飞云楼上待云生，浴日亭前观日出。\n小金山似大金山，胜地人誇黄木湾。\n石屏台古土花紫，翠竹庵深春昼闲。\n刘王花坞花非故，挹翠亭空谁复步。\n堂缘后学思退之，楼为君王问丰度。\n滴水岩垂百尺帘，平湖阁题千万篇。\n红梅岭头簇车马，白猿洞口迷云烟。\n歌仙岩上招群鹤，小西湖边洗双脚。\n月溪春风花正浓，石门斜日潮初落。\n寺号飞来知有无，亭名通越失崎岖。\n忠襄遗庙草长碧，文献荒祠柏半枯。\n大通昨夜龙听法，宝陀谁梦僧饭客。\n杯渡庵空春草生，鉴空阁前秋月白。\n君归毗陵兴不孤，我写新诗作画图。\n约君重来续清赏，岭南嘉景无时无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51969,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆荔枝","author":"江源","text":"岭南五月薰风吹，荔枝初熟红累垂。\n千树瑩煌照林麓，忆曾饱食为儿时。\n君谟品尔为第一，何乃昔贤比尤物。\n交南入献永元时，涪州取贡天宝日。\n绛囊中裹白玉肌，琼浆一割甘如饴。\n回看百果无颜色，况复蒲萄能拟之。\n嗟彼美兮生岭峤，可怜此味人知少。\n千年每恨妃子污，一旦更遭侧生诮。\n蠲渴补髓堪延年，故园怅别路几千。\n感时抚景每忆汝，饥肠馋喙长流涎。\n思莼客子浮归舸，我尚风波未回柁。\n何年解组赋归来，坦腹日餐三百颗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51970,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏龙眼","author":"江源","text":"荔枝龙眼真并驱，大乔小乔两名姝。\n先生后生伯仲耳，胡为呼汝荔枝奴。\n魏文珍异特有诏，君谟遗落不作图。\n秋风弱弱吹正熟，枝头万颗骊龙珠。\n黄金包子乍擘破，容色瑩洁滑腻肤。\n百果羞缩不敢前，玉液入口风味孤。\n我欲荐之九重备玉食，又恐如汉十里一置，五里一堠，人马俱毙长安衢。\n宁教置身炎州幽侧地，不与杨梅庐橘争献承明庐。\n独不闻苏子当年有至论，蛮荒非汝辱，倖免妃子污。\n至今为汝数传诵，千载一洗旁挺诬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51971,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝泽卷为陈司训题","author":"江源","text":"考亭夫子小学书，岂非大学之权舆。\n修齐治平不出此，欲我小子佩服身心与之俱。\n守拙老翁默契此，手抄教子真良图。\n日用常行有根本，后来二子皆名儒。\n此翁既没不可见，见此手泽当何如。\n朝焉展之如当时之面命，暮焉展之似前日之庭趋。\n羹墙之见亦若此，寒暑与具无斯须。\n百年自我敢废坠，芸香裹里无蠹鱼。\n宝此手泽得所宝，不宝明月与璠玙。\n斯人即此见至孝，无乃大舜之徒欤。\n吁噫，古人陈迹弗复道，且看今人积金万万与子何其愚。\n奈何身后肉未冷，遭此不肖荡折而无馀。\n何如此翁善遗子，子亦体亲诚不孤。\n父慈子孝两相得，足为后世后学之楷模。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51972,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扇面山水二首 其一","author":"江源","text":"秋水棹归船，风光兴杳然。\n两人相对语，语到伏羲前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51973,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扇面山水二首 其二 次西涯韵","author":"江源","text":"野景年年在，山人日日闲。\n过桥看活水，不是爱潺湲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51974,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行杂咏十首 其一","author":"江源","text":"长风送轻舸，晚山飞翠浮。\n掀篷待月上，不减赤壁游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51975,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行杂咏十首 其二","author":"江源","text":"江上几日行，奈此跋涉苦。\n云起先泊舟，恐有暴风雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51976,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行杂咏十首 其三","author":"江源","text":"山暝碧云合，秋初白雁征。\n几多游宦客，徒有故园情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51977,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行杂咏十首 其四","author":"江源","text":"凉风吹我衣，壮观倚楼橹。\n沙水鸥群浴，风樯燕双舞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51978,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行杂咏十首 其五","author":"江源","text":"作客二十载，扁舟西复东。\n不因俯仰累，谁肯任飘蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51979,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行杂咏十首 其六","author":"江源","text":"路长寄书少，水涸归舟迟。\n渔子团栾乐，焉知人别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51980,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行杂咏十首 其七","author":"江源","text":"长江自朝夕，落日照今古。\n无酒长独醒，只恐叹渔父。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51981,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行杂咏十首 其八","author":"江源","text":"今朝江上路，明日复何之。\n踪迹已无定，前程焉可期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51982,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行杂咏十首 其九","author":"江源","text":"山色已含暝，叶声新报秋。\n廿年尘土客，吟眺不胜愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51983,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行杂咏十首 其十","author":"江源","text":"频年走畏涂，轮蹄带倾覆。\n白首好归休，何必恋爵禄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51984,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题莲塘书屋壁","author":"江源","text":"骑马访莲塘，东风花草香。\n定如云谷里，不足辋川庄。\n景好诗难状，心情俗易忘。\n主人如许我，卜筑近东墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51985,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下第","author":"江源","text":"败将难言勇，迂儒敢论文。\n高堂垂白发，蹇足阻青云。\n僮仆厌贫父，文章叹命迍。\n授衣时节近，灯火又相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51986,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贫士吟","author":"江源","text":"乾坤双草屐，风雨一茅庐。\n不恨瓶无粟，空怜架有书。\n帘帷旧燕入，门巷故交疏。\n贫贱乃常理，何须光范趋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51987,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"到上饶","author":"江源","text":"来尹上饶邑，中心喜惧并。\n有家惭肉食，无术慰苍生。\n灵鹫插天碧，冰溪逼渭清。\n循良期远到，不是爱沽名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51988,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"娄侍御召游茶山寺","author":"江源","text":"秋日游山寺，风烟入眼嘉。\n主人罗绮席，野衲献茶瓜。\n凫鸟联骢马，庭莎间菊花。\n登临有馀兴，归路不嫌赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51989,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"起取口号","author":"江源","text":"奉檄来饶邑，扪心愧牧夫。\n肥甘徒自养，凋弊未能苏。\n万里趋明诏，三年起仕涂。\n勖哉自今始，持此谢吾徒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51990,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿彭城值雨写怀","author":"江源","text":"彭城经信宿，风急雨霏霏。\n绕砌虫声乱，隔江人语稀。\n对床诗独在，戏马事全非。\n无限关心事，挑灯读楚词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51991,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏夜","author":"江源","text":"入夜添衣坐，炎天雨后凉。\n教儿温旧习，呼婢换新汤。\n脱帽风吹发，开窗月到床。\n兴来聊短述，还似少年狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51992,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客思","author":"江源","text":"奔走云中路，淹留客邸秋。\n此身千里外，归梦五更头。\n朔吹淩衰鬓，清霜拂弊裘。\n家书浑欲寄，只恐雁沈浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51993,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过滕茂实墓有感宋工部侍郎为金人所留下不屈死，其兄先降金矣","author":"江源","text":"兄弟俱官宋，拘留共在金。\n浮沉奴婢态，铁石丈夫心。\n朽骨人争唾，荒坟我独寻。\n千秋青史上，芳臭不同襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51994,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"公馆漫兴","author":"江源","text":"上谷回车辙，凄凉午夜天。\n观风千里远，见月两回圆。\n离别寻常事，奔趋二十年。\n归京多便使，书劄若为传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51995,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灵丘道傍老树","author":"江源","text":"老树数千尺，风霜几百年。\n十围堪大用，寸朽为人捐。\n古干淩云外，清阴散道边。\n踌躇因尔惜，寄语庙堂贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51996,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书大同公馆壁","author":"江源","text":"自古平城地，山河百二重。\n将军休出塞，胡虏正潜踪。\n戍士多艰食，边民亦废农。\n轮台须有诏，西北甚疲癃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51997,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"腊月三日涂中遣怀","author":"江源","text":"岁暮思绵绵，流光又一年。\n乾坤将老客，风雨上滩船。\n冻雀先春语，梅花破腊妍。\n旅愁应不减，回首向南天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51998,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客夜","author":"江源","text":"终夕频烧烛，长吟独据床。\n不因冬夜永，只是客愁长。\n近郭闻鸡唱，推蓬爱月光。\n家人亦思我，江上望归航。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":51999,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中口号二首 其一","author":"江源","text":"江水悠悠去，青山衮衮来。\n开尊自斟酌，得句费敲推。\n淑气回汀草，春光泄野梅。\n偶然忘客虑，微醉独徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52000,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中口号二首 其二","author":"江源","text":"此岁亦云暮，长涂未泣穷。\n雨淹孤客棹，天助一帆风。\n皂阁暮云外，金川醉眼中。\n百年皆逆旅，随处任飘逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52001,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富春舟中偶成三首 其一","author":"江源","text":"客舟快如马，又过富春亭。\n我拜羊裘老，谁占使者星。\n凭高双眼阔，夹水两山青。\n迢递此风景，还如昔所经。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52002,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富春舟中偶成三首 其二","author":"江源","text":"趍程心似火，随寓迹如萍。\n须鬓旋添白，江山不改青。\n船头风猎猎，岛外雨冥冥。\n消遣瓶无酒，渔人笑我醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52003,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"富春舟中偶成三首 其三","author":"江源","text":"客路秋将暮，云山日未残。\n水枯回棹涩，家远得书难。\n事少恣高卧，年衰但强餐。\n乘槎沧海上，昨夜梦长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52004,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中重阳写怀二首 其一","author":"江源","text":"九日沙溪路，舟中可当家。\n菊应无处觅，酒亦不须赊。\n酩酊思陶令，登临愧孟嘉。\n廿年此奔走，徒羡晚归鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52005,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中重阳写怀二首 其二","author":"江源","text":"屈指重阳近，谁邀把菊欢。\n忽叹秋渐老，转觉雨添寒。\n秉烛看雄剑，呼汤咽药丸。\n病妻书昨得，多是劝加餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52006,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄故园知己","author":"江源","text":"江上多秋色，天涯无故人。\n不因会面少，那得寄书频。\n冷露屯残菊，西风老白蘋。\n相思兼物色，添得客愁新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52007,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蜀贞妇刘氏割股","author":"江源","text":"西蜀朱家妇，非邀割股名。\n但知夫婿重，翻视妾身□。\n大义缘天性，皇穹鉴此诚。\n莫云便陈迹，千古竹书荣。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52008,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发进贤","author":"江源","text":"月色留墙角，晨光隐市楼。\n山人方转枕，游子已乘辀。\n鸡唱催晴旭，林霖湿弊裘。\n回头看朝市，应不似林丘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52009,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小溪驿壁","author":"江源","text":"迢递小溪路，相违又七春。\n江山千里旧，时事一番新。\n南粤年年梦，西风处处尘。\n不须逢桀溺，久客颇知津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52010,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过湖口","author":"江源","text":"官船湖口路，匆冗不登临。\n野寺悬危石，人家隔远林。\n雨馀山拥翠，日落水浮金。\n爱此未能去，停桡付短吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52011,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游东林寺","author":"江源","text":"天竺曾三到，东林始一游。\n匡庐不改色，莲社已成丘。\n山雨千溪涨，松风六月秋。\n奇观恐难再，诗为野僧留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52012,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日客中感怀次大参陈德修韵二首 其一","author":"江源","text":"我来逢九日，市酒不须赊。\n独客惊蓬鬓，三年负菊花。\n山梨经雨落，江柳挟风斜。\n孤此登高兴，无诗纪岁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52013,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日客中感怀次大参陈德修韵二首 其二","author":"江源","text":"佳节客中至，乡关望里赊。\n新篘酒应熟，旧圃菊初花。\n霜压草头重，风吹雨脚斜。\n流光催我老，五十一年华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52014,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送内弟蒋时雍南归四首 其一","author":"江源","text":"春闱三挟策，京国五飞瑩。\n天意亦仁爱，君子待老成。\n逢人休说命，闻礼且趋庭。\n去去莫迟马，倚门朝暮情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52015,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送内弟蒋时雍南归四首 其二","author":"江源","text":"风骨非凡俗，文章即大家。\n酒杯消别恨，往事付长嗟。\n夜雨粤山梦，秋风赣水艖。\n到家重九月，篱菊尚留花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52016,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送内弟蒋时雍南归四首 其三","author":"江源","text":"瓜葛情逾密，江山兴更佳。\n挑灯通夕话，对酒十年怀。\n浅水淹归棹，霜风散宿霾。\n壮年霄汉业，叹我老形骸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52017,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送内弟蒋时雍南归四首 其四","author":"江源","text":"半月联舟楫，终宵共叹谈。\n诗从高兴发，酒为故情酣。\n木落山逾瘦，秋清水蔚蓝。\n天公知子意，风送此归帆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52018,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赣州分司夜坐","author":"江源","text":"九月虔州暖，闾阎未授衣。\n蚊雷犹夜闹，蟋蟀未人依。\n入馔秋蔬嫩，输官晚稻肥。\n观风今日事，随处采民诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52019,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴","author":"江源","text":"十载客他乡，逢人问草堂。\n秋风松桂老，春雨秫田荒。\n稚子慵书计，山妻幂酒浆。\n浮名更何用，终日簿书忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52020,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后九月九日","author":"江源","text":"秋色将相暮，开怀合举觞。\n百年双短发，一岁两重阳。\n往事已流水，菊花犹晚香。\n独斟拼一醉，不惜老年狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52021,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雩都道中遣怀四首 其一","author":"江源","text":"倦客路迢递，残秋思寂寥。\n风高摧木叶，岚重没山椒。\n身寓江湖远，心驰魏阙遥。\n小诗浑漫兴，陶谢不须招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52022,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雩都道中遣怀四首 其二","author":"江源","text":"三秋孤客棹，一水两边山。\n近郭少佳木，急流多险滩。\n徒誇青紫贵，不似白云闲。\n试看柴桑老，焉知生计悭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52023,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雩都道中遣怀四首 其三","author":"江源","text":"乌府观风客，雩都逆水舟。\n怪禽啼落日，顽石激湍流。\n去就非荣辱，天人敢怨尤。\n我生只如此，萧散未须忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52024,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雩都道中遣怀四首 其四","author":"江源","text":"终日驾危楫，何年脱畏涂。\n洁身固无义，恋禄亦非夫。\n水缩沙堆出，山寒石发枯。\n掩蓬坐深夜，灯影照羁孤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52025,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"会昌道中三首 其一","author":"江源","text":"过峡二三里，举头千万峰。\n滴蓬江雨润，栖石湿云浓。\n恋主心徒切，安民意未慵。\n但惭才薄劣，十郡正疲癃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52026,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"会昌道中三首 其二","author":"江源","text":"客程多险隘，岐路足风烟。\n云傍山腰宿，舟从石罅穿。\n乡心秋雨外，归目断鸿边。\n未老须回首，人生无百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52027,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿齐磨","author":"江源","text":"一宿齐磨地，孤村人闭门。\n滩声无日夜，山色异朝昏。\n舴艋依沙泊，莎鸡傍草喧。\n旅游滋味薄，谁复劝加餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52028,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"江源","text":"天上宜辞禄，山中拟结茅。\n贵长思少贱，富敢忘贫交。\n敏慧于时合，迂疏被俗嘲。\n区区何足问，骑马出江郊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52029,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和小溪驿原韵","author":"江源","text":"再到小溪驲，风光值小春。\n云归山色暝，水涸岸痕新。\n旷岁少家信，污人多陌尘。\n西江回画鹢，章贡是通津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":52030,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]